 "ShipDefinition;Shard Class Corvette;SHP;This compact warship is well equipped for defending coastal areas, armed with a 57mm cannon, 20mm point defense system, and battery of vertically launched RAM-45 missiles. A small landing pad at the stern allows it to serve as a mobile re-arming and refueling point for helicopters.;76.2;10.5;13.8;78.14812;0;0;0;0;0;0;15000;9000;3;1;25000;0.5;4;3;0.1;0;0;10;25;190;45;4;8;1;0;0;0.645;0.9;0.9;0.9;0": [
