 "ShipDefinition;Dynamo Class Destroyer;SHP;This guided missile destroyer is armed with a battery of vertically launched cruise missiles and a 155mm railgun in its forward turret. Its powerful defensive armament of two MMR-S3 batteries, three R9 vertical launchers and four 30mm CIWS turrets, makes the Dynamo class a powerful warship, able to defend a fleet from any threat.;162;22;32;166.5893;0;0;0;0;0;0;30000;15000;3;1;60000;0.5;4;3;0.1;0;0;10;100;1350;180;5;30;1;0;0;0.645;0.95;0.95;0.9;0": [
