 "ShipDefinition;Annex Class Carrier;SHP;An amphibious assault ship which can support rotary wing and V/STOL aircraft operations. It has a well deck from which it can launch landing craft, and it can perform shore bombardment with its 76mm cannon and dual-purpose 40mm point defence guns.;242;40;50;250.3278;0;0;0;0;0;0;50000;0;0;1;50000;0.5;4;3;0.1;0;0;100;50;3500;2000;5;40;1;0;0;0.645;0.95;0.95;0.95;0": [
