 "\"description\": \"Learn how to prepare for and perform a landing. For this lesson you will be piloting the T/A-30 Compass trainer aircraft.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"description\": \"Fly a T/A-30 Compass on a ground attack mission. Use missiles, rockets, bombs and guns to destroy a BDF convoy of lightly defended vehicles.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"Message\": \"The BDF is on the run, and trying to evacuate as much fuel from the area as they can.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"Message\": \"A large convoy of fuel trucks was last spotted about 5km north of Dustbowl. We're headed to the convoy's last known position.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"Message\": \"Your aircraft's visual sensors can detect ground vehicles within a range of 6km. We are to locate and destroy the convoy.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"Message\": \"Excellent work, every convoy vehicle has been destroyed.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"Message\": \"Convoy has been spotted. Lets get to work.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"description\": \"Fly the SFB-81 Darkreach on a bombing mission to destroy a PALA vehicle depot on a heavily defended airbase.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"Message\": \"Recon says there are Radar SAMs scattered throughout the surrounding valley. Stay alert for radar warnings.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"Message\": \"Stay on guard for enemy aircraft in the area. If you spot any, let your wingmen deal with them.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"Message\": \"Today we're striking a vehicle depot located on the enemy's airbase.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"description\": \"Learn how to manage throttle, brake and rudder to safely taxi to the runway, before conducting your first take off. For this lesson you will be piloting the T/A-30 Compass trainer aircraft.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"body\": \"As we approach the runway threshold, we will make another left turn to line up the plane on the runway.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"body\": \"Now turn left and keep the plane centered on the runway.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"description\": \"Learn how to defeat semi-active radar homing missiles. For this lesson you will be piloting the T/A-30 Compass trainer aircraft.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"body\": \"The emission from the radar is detectable by your radar receiver, and the direction to the radar is indicated by an orange line on the minimap. As radar based detection relies on bouncing a signal off of something, you can detect radar emissions at approximately double the range of a radar system.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"description\": \"Learn how to designate targets and use missiles to destroy them. For this lesson you will be piloting the T/A-30 Compass trainer aircraft.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"body\": \"Excellent work. This concludes Targeting and Weapons.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"description\": \"Use the FS-12 Revoker to intercept a volley of cruise missiles launched at your base from Primeva.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
 "\"Message\": \"Well done, the threat has been neutralized.\",": [
  "resources.assets"
 ],
